# What `vercel deploy` uploads. The Vercel CLI does NOT read .gitignore: without
# this file it would upload everything in the directory except a short built-in
# list, including .env and config/config-*-secret.json5 (the Anthropic API key).
#
# So this is an allowlist: ignore everything at the root, then name what the
# Next.js build needs. A new top-level file or folder the build reads must be
# added here, or the build on Vercel fails for a missing module.
/*
!/app
!/components
!/hooks
!/lib
!/data
!/instrumentation-client.ts
!/next.config.js
!/package.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/postcss.config.mjs
!/tailwind.config.ts
!/tsconfig.json
!/vercel.json
